---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<Layout title="My Story" description="Learn about the author behind InterestArt—a software engineering student exploring the connection between code precision and fine art expression.">
  <div class="about-header">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h1>The Mind Behind the Studio</h1>
      <p class="about-tagline">{siteConfig.author.name} &middot; Creator of InterestArt</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container about-container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Image Column -->
      <div class="about-image-side">
        <img 
          src="/images/profile.jpg" 
          alt={siteConfig.author.name} 
          class="profile-image" 
        />
        <p class="image-note">
          {siteConfig.author.name} &middot; Software Engineering Student & Artist
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Column -->
      <div class="about-text-side">
        <h2>Why InterestArt?</h2>
        <p class="about-highlight">
          {siteConfig.author.description}
        </p>
        <p>
          In a world governed by deterministic logic, clean functions, and strict borders, coding offers a beautiful cerebral playground. However, spending hours behind a glowing monitor can leave one craving something tactile, physical, and expressive.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started InterestArt as a digital notebook to document my balance. Stripping away the pressure of perfection, I began working with messy charcoal sticks, clay pinch bowls, and cold-press watercolor pads. Here, I explore techniques, write about masters, and share low-pressure lessons to encourage others to step away from screens and create.
        </p>

        <div class="philosophy-box">
          <h3>My Creative Philosophy</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Wabi-Sabi:</strong> Celebrate minor wobbles, coarse paper grains, and asymmetric contours. The charm of art is in the maker's hand.</li>
            <li><strong>Mindful Routines:</strong> Focus on the process of drawing rather than the finished product. Five minutes of doodling is a win.</li>
            <li><strong>Code and Pigment:</strong> Structure helps expression. The rules of perspective and value ranges are just as beautiful as clean functions.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="milestones-placeholder">
          <h3>Artistic Timeline</h3>
          <p class="placeholder-warning-note">
            Note: This timeline is for demonstration purposes. Feel free to replace these milestones with your actual artistic journey.
          </p>
          <div class="milestone-item">
            <div class="milestone-year">2025</div>
            <div class="milestone-details">
              <h4>First Watercolor Wash</h4>
              <p>Began studying classic wash methods in the backyard after writing college Java programs.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="milestone-item">
            <div class="milestone-year">2025</div>
            <div class="milestone-details">
              <h4>Tactile Clay Explorations</h4>
              <p>Acquired low-fire clay and began pinch pot handbuilding without a pottery wheel.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="milestone-item">
            <div class="milestone-year">2026</div>
            <div class="milestone-details">
              <h4>Launching InterestArt</h4>
              <p>Built this Astro platform to gather tutorials, art history breakdowns, and studio prompts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-header {
    padding: 5rem 0 3rem 0;
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .about-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .about-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .about-container {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 350px 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }

  .about-image-side {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .profile-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 350px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .profile-image:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .image-note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-text-side h2 {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-highlight {
    font-family: var(--font-artistic);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem 0;
  }

  .about-text-side p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .philosophy-box {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 2rem;
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }
  .philosophy-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .philosophy-box ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .philosophy-box li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Milestones timeline */
  .milestones-placeholder {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 3rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  .milestones-placeholder h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .placeholder-warning-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem !important;
    color: var(--color-text-muted) !important;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 2rem !important;
  }
  .milestone-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .milestone-year {
    font-family: var(--font-artistic);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .milestone-details h4 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .milestone-details p {
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    color: var(--color-text-muted) !important;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
